      "id": 16478,
      "name": "robb8888",
      "username": "robb8888",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-04-06T07:02:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was playing a practice version of this week's one-shot (PW Tempest, RC Wraith, TLT, GI Bunker, Termi-AZ vs. Ultimate Voss in Megalopolis). &nbsp;I was pretty far along, Wraith had most of her equipment out, and I used two Impromptu Inventions in a row to get out all three of her Mega-Computers. &nbsp; When I played the third, I got the attached image -- the giant word \"Intervene\", with the Wraith in front of her computer. &nbsp;Pressing anywhere on the screen (iPad) just took me to the \"replacements\" page on the Sentinelsofthemultiverse.com website, (where one can buy replacement decks, etc.). &nbsp; There seems to be no way to get back to the actual game itself, short of closing and reopening. &nbsp;Anyone know what this is?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>UPDATE: &nbsp; This is repeatable. &nbsp;I ended up closing out the app, re-opening, hitting \"Continue Game, \" and trying to play the same card combo -- it did it again. &nbsp;I went back a third time, took a screen shot of Wraith's position before playing those cards, in case anyone is interested.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/db657240e2e57d882a4504db3332bd5b646e5f73.png\" alt=\"IMG_2277.PNG\" data-base62-sha1=\"viRUEnge1ohMwdbA1bnBlKz8VLZ\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\"></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-20T18:36:58.913Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
