      "raw": "<p>I was playing a practice version of this week&#39;s one-shot (PW Tempest, RC Wraith, TLT, GI Bunker, Termi-AZ vs. Ultimate Voss in Megalopolis). &nbsp;I was pretty far along, Wraith had most of her equipment out, and I used two Impromptu Inventions in a row to get out all three of her Mega-Computers. &nbsp; When I played the third, I got the attached image -- the giant word &quot;Intervene&quot;, with the Wraith in front of her computer. &nbsp;Pressing anywhere on the screen (iPad) just took me to the &quot;replacements&quot; page on the Sentinelsofthemultiverse.com website, (where one can buy replacement decks, etc.). &nbsp; There seems to be no way to get back to the actual game itself, short of closing and reopening. &nbsp;Anyone know what this is?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>UPDATE: &nbsp; This is repeatable. &nbsp;I ended up closing out the app, re-opening, hitting &quot;Continue Game, &quot; and trying to play the same card combo -- it did it again. &nbsp;I went back a third time, took a screen shot of Wraith&#39;s position before playing those cards, in case anyone is interested.</p>\n\n![IMG_2277.PNG|320x240](upload://viRUEnge1ohMwdbA1bnBlKz8VLZ.png)",
