      "created_at": "2017-04-06T08:22:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This was part of the Oblivaeon ARG (a huge puzzle that introduced the Oblivaeon events)...maybe a year ago?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There were a series of nine-letter words to solve which unlocked different comics and stories of Oblivaeon. Not all in the video game, but in various places throughout the internet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It all began with our friend Tim Cosing &nbsp;(It's coming).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
